{"product_id":"a-daughters-journey","title":"A daughter's journey","description":"\u003cp\u003eA captivating new saga set in Liverpool and Ireland, from the bestselling author of DAYS OF HOPE and FAR FROM HOME Angela O'Rourke is six when her parents hand her over to an aunt and uncle in a distant village. It's a common practice for large, hard-up families in 1950s Ireland , but for Angela it means that her mother and father don't love her any more. Still, she's well cared for till she's sixteen, when her uncle starts to take too much of an interest in her. Moving to Liverpool in the early 1960s, she becomes a success in the world of fashion design. The pain of a disastrous love affair sends her home to Ireland just after the death of her aunt: and there, among old papers, Angela makes an astonishing discovery. As she learns the truth about the past, a brighter new future beckons. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lyn Andrews \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780755354399 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 448\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44970816602265,"sku":"13RD9780755354399","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/d42f54872e50cf27011fc35e2020a721.jpg?v=1732124240","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/a-daughters-journey","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}